ca Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">索尼等35家音乐出版商起诉Anthropic，指控其非法使用版权作品训练Claude</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek开源首个视觉实验模型DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic与Lambda签署350亿美元云计算协议以扩充算力基础设施</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果在商业秘密诉讼中追加指控OpenAI利用涉密技术发展硬件业务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/85ccac4a2f2d02b72ccfe837b26b23ed.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司于8月31日提交支持文件，在针对OpenAI的商业秘密诉讼中追加关键证据，指控其利用窃取的涉密技术支持新硬件业务。核心争议指向前苹果高级系统电气工程师刘畅，调查显示其离职前下载了包含电路原理图在内的数十份机密文件，并加入OpenAI后在公司发放的MacBook上运行电路仿真程序，甚至利用专有数据训练AI Agent。苹果进一步指控刘畅在获悉内部调查后，曾指示同事重置设备以销毁取证痕迹。目前，苹果已申请加快取证程序，并将审查范围扩大至11名前员工。OpenAI此前回应称指控缺乏根据。此案凸显了生成式AI与前沿硬件融合背景下，高端人才流动引发的知识产权与数据合规风险，后续裁决或将重塑科技巨头与AI企业间的人才流动及合规审查机制。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯发布混元Hy4预览版，参数规模增至7700亿并支持百万token</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a32dfb79f40f3ed73e377d63b42b5bce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯正式发布混元Hy4预览版，该模型采用混合专家架构，总参数量达7700亿，激活参数量为490亿，较上一代Hy3实现倍增。在长文本处理能力上，Hy4预览版支持100万token上下文窗口，远超Hy3的25.6万token。在腾讯内部双盲评测中，该模型取得2.99分（满分4分），并在第三方代码能力榜单中表现优异。此次迭代由首席AI科学家姚顺雨团队主导，研发节奏显著加快，预计Hy4正式版将提前落地。该模型在软件开发、游戏开发及科研等场景的生产力表现，将与腾讯游戏、广告及云服务业务深度协同，转化为商业增量。摩根士丹利基于此进展维持腾讯增持评级，目标价设为550港元。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">索尼等35家音乐出版商起诉Anthropic，指控其非法使用版权作品训练Claude</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/477fab6f6fc0f44cc26876b6729c9256.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">索尼音乐出版、华纳查佩尔音乐等35家音乐出版商近日向美国加州北区联邦地区法院提起诉讼，指控Anthropic及其联合创始人达里奥·阿莫代伊与本杰明·曼在未经授权的情况下，通过BT下载和网络爬虫抓取数万份受版权保护的歌词与乐谱，用于训练Claude大模型。原告方在48页诉状中将此行为定性为“史上最公然的知识产权盗窃之一”，涉及泰勒·斯威夫特等多位知名艺人作品。根据美国版权法，每件侵权作品最高可索赔15万美元，若按数万件作品计算，整体索赔规模或达数十亿美元。原告要求法院下达禁令，阻止Anthropic继续使用相关版权素材。Anthropic对此回应称不认同全部指控，将积极抗辩。此次诉讼正值Anthropic筹备IPO的关键窗口期，或将对其上市进程产生重大不确定性影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek开源首个视觉实验模型DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/31ad7bf053179e7d293d02d25e43572c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek正式开源其V4系列首个实验性多模态模型DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp。该模型基于V4-Flash架构深度融合视觉模块，总参数量达3050亿。技术上，它在保持V4-Flash原有文本处理与Agent任务能力的基础上，新增了深度的图片理解与分析功能，能够结合外部工具独立执行复杂多模态Agent任务。官方评测显示，其多模态综合表现已接近行业顶尖水平。为推动技术普惠，该模型采用MIT许可证开源，允许全球开发者及企业进行二次开发与商业集成。此次发布旨在通过开源生态加速多模态应用落地，为行业提供高性能的视觉理解基座，助力开发者在合规前提下进行技术创新与产品集成。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic与Lambda签署350亿美元云计算协议以扩充算力基础设施</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日与英伟达支持的云服务商Lambda签署价值350亿美元的云计算协议，旨在缓解其AI模型训练面临的算力瓶颈。该协议涉及复杂的产业协同：数据中心由Hut8在得克萨斯州建设，租赁权归属英伟达，Lambda负责部署英伟达芯片并向Anthropic提供云服务。这是Anthropic近期继与Nscale达成450亿美元算力租赁协议后的又一重大布局，其目标是在2027年底启用英伟达Vera Rubin芯片算力。此外，Anthropic正同步推进由谷歌提供财务担保、搭载谷歌TPU的数据中心建设，以实现硬件生态的多元互补。尽管英伟达曾计划为Lambda等厂商提供信贷支持以换取收入分成，但受反垄断合规影响，该计划部分交易已暂停。此次合作标志着AI巨头在底层硬件基础设施上的竞争进入深度博弈阶段。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
